WEBVTT

1

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:19.167

Again?!



2

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.042

What the hell is that sound?!



3

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.792

While stopped at the ruins

of Utgard Castle to take a brief break,



4

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:35.917

the Scouts were overwhelmed by a Titan assault,

vanquishing their hope of survival.



5

00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:37.333

--Nanaba...

--No! No!



6

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:38.875

--And Gelgar...

--No! No!



7

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.875

Father, stop!



8

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.333

However, in that moment...



9

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.792

Christa.



10

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:48.875

This is nothing more than a hope of mine...



11

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:53.250

I want you... to live a life you're proud of.



12

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.500

Ymir! Wait!



13

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:00.958

...Ymir suddenly transformed into a Titan.



14

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.500

Keep it up, Ymir!



15

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:07.917

Want live...?



16

00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:09.917

Grab me!



17

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:17.708

This looks bad.



18

00:01:20.042 --> 00:01:22.042

Ymir is...



19

00:01:22.042 --> 00:01:23.667

This can't...



20

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.417

This can't...



21

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:30.208

I still haven't told you my real name!



22

00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:38.042

And then the main force of the Scouts

rushed in to engage the enemy.



23

00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:39.208

Die!



24

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.500

They successfully dismantled the Titan attack.



25

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.042

However,



26

00:01:51.042 --> 00:01:57.542

upon the ruins of battle,

Eren and the others learn a surprising truth.



27

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:00.542

Ymir...



28

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:03.750

My real name...



29

00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:07.458

...is Historia.



30

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:51.958

"Warrior"



31

00:04:12.542 --> 00:04:14.125

Slowly!



32

00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:16.000

Bring it up slowly!



33

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.083

Raise it carefully now!



34

00:04:27.458 --> 00:04:32.083

How's Ymir? What sort of shape is she in?



35

00:04:32.083 --> 00:04:37.375

Her right arm and leg were bitten off,

and her insides are beaten like scrambled eggs.



36

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:40.875

If she was normal, she'd be dead for sure.



37

00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:46.250

If she was normal, huh?



38

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:57.250

Reiner! Grab on!



39

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.375

Right!



40

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.458

Please, believe me!



41

00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:05.833

I'm telling the truth!



42

00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:11.250

Ymir transformed into a Titan

to fight off the other Titans and save us!



43

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:17.583

She did so with no regard for her own life,

which proves her loyalty to us, her comrades!



44

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:22.083

It's true that her judgement

until now is unforgivable.



45

00:05:22.083 --> 00:05:27.583

After all, she may know things useful

to humanity and yet she kept quiet about it!



46

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:32.917

I imagine she didn't say anything

in order to protect herself.



47

00:05:32.917 --> 00:05:35.917

But... now she's a changed person!



48

00:05:35.917 --> 00:05:38.542

Ymir is an ally of humanity!



49

00:05:38.542 --> 00:05:40.917

I know Ymir better than anybody.



50

00:05:40.917 --> 00:05:43.958

She's a much simpler person than she looks!



51

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.875

I see.



52

00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:52.500

Obviously, I hope we can build

a trusting relationship with her.



53

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:58.458

Her judgement aside, the information

she holds is a treasure for humanity.



54

00:05:58.458 --> 00:06:00.125

I hope we get along.



55

00:06:01.625 --> 00:06:03.708

But you know...



56

00:06:03.708 --> 00:06:06.292

...even if she is a simple person,



57

00:06:06.292 --> 00:06:10.500

this world becomes more of a

confusing mess with every passing day.



58

00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:17.917

You said... your real name was Historia Reiss?



59

00:06:17.917 --> 00:06:20.125

Yes, that's right.



60

00:06:20.125 --> 00:06:23.417

Reiss, as in that noble family?



61

00:06:24.583 --> 00:06:26.500

Yes.



62

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.708

I see.



63

00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:34.500

Nice to meet you, Historia.



64

00:06:35.792 --> 00:06:37.458

Yeah...



65

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:42.958

How's Ymir?



66

00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:45.042

She's still in a coma.



67

00:06:45.042 --> 00:06:49.667

Her bleeding has stopped, and we think

steam is coming out of her wounds.



68

00:06:51.542 --> 00:06:57.125

For now, take her back to Trost

so she can get some proper medical care.



69

00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:58.542

She's in your hands.



70

00:06:58.542 --> 00:07:00.042

Understood.



71

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:03.708

Now then...



72

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:08.500

Our original mission... was to seal this wall.



73

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.792

Damn, it hurts.



74

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.542

You all right, Reiner?



75

00:07:26.542 --> 00:07:29.167

Not by a long shot.



76

00:07:29.167 --> 00:07:31.958

A Titan nearly gnawed off my arm.



77

00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:35.292

That was... pathetic.



78

00:07:35.292 --> 00:07:37.167

I thought I was done for.



79

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:48.750

Even someone as strong as you

gets this way sometimes.



80

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:52.292

What are you talking about?

This is the second time for me!



81

00:07:52.292 --> 00:07:53.708

Tell him, Armin.



82

00:07:53.708 --> 00:07:54.917

Huh?



83

00:07:54.917 --> 00:07:59.167

Remember the time I almost

got crushed in that Titan's hand?



84

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:00.750

Oh...



85

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:05.167

Back then...



86

00:08:05.167 --> 00:08:08.292

That makes twice I've nearly died.



87

00:08:08.292 --> 00:08:12.000

At this rate, I'll be dead before I know it.



88

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.125

I picked this path on my own,

but being a soldier is rough.



89

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:20.542

It's like a soldier's spirit

breaks down before their body.



90

00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:25.917

Though, until we plug up this wall,



91

00:08:25.917 --> 00:08:28.792

there's no time to waste whining about it.



92

00:08:28.792 --> 00:08:30.333

Yeah.



93

00:08:30.333 --> 00:08:34.833

You two have been driven

far enough away from your hometown.



94

00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:38.375

I'm thinking... this is where

we gotta draw the line.



95

00:08:40.542 --> 00:08:42.708

He's right, Reiner!



96

00:08:42.708 --> 00:08:45.250

Our hometown! Let's return!



97

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.500

Isn't it about time to go back?



98

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:51.875

Compared to all the trouble we've

been through, what's left to do is nothing!



99

00:08:52.917 --> 00:08:54.458

That's right.



100

00:08:54.458 --> 00:08:57.917

We're so close, it's just

another few steps till the end.



101

00:08:57.917 --> 00:09:00.083

Huh?



102

00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:03.167

What are you guys talking about?



103

00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:09.500

Thanks, Mikasa.



104

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.958

Are you hurt?



105

00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:17.667

I'm fine, but... Reiner got his arm bit

and Ymir is as you can see.



106

00:09:17.667 --> 00:09:21.042

Who would've thought Ymir was a Titan, too?



107

00:09:21.042 --> 00:09:21.625

Does that--?



108

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:22.750

Sasha.



109

00:09:23.792 --> 00:09:25.417

Is everyone clear?



110

00:09:25.417 --> 00:09:28.042

We'll deal with Ymir later.



111

00:09:28.042 --> 00:09:29.917

And Conny...



112

00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:33.625

I'll arrange for a Scout squad

to investigate your village later.



113

00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:38.083

For the time being, I want you to focus

on the mission to fix the wall.



114

00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:39.000

Got it?



115

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.125

Got it!



116

00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:46.167

Still... I expected this place

to be swarming with Titans.



117

00:09:49.042 --> 00:09:50.833

Hannes?



118

00:09:50.833 --> 00:09:53.417

It's the Garrison's advance squad.



119

00:09:53.417 --> 00:09:55.875

They came to tell us where the hole is.



120

00:10:03.042 --> 00:10:05.542

There's no hole anywhere!



121

00:10:05.542 --> 00:10:06.708

Huh?



122

00:10:06.708 --> 00:10:09.250

We spent all night looking for it...



123

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:14.333

...but at least between Trost and Krolva District,

there's nothing wrong with the wall.



124

00:10:14.333 --> 00:10:16.375

What'd you say?



125

00:10:16.375 --> 00:10:20.292

We bumped into soldiers from Krolva

and retraced our steps.



126

00:10:20.292 --> 00:10:23.500

We haven't seen any Titans the whole way here.



127

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:27.792

But... we know for sure there's Titans

on this side of the wall.



128

00:10:27.792 --> 00:10:31.333

Did you actually look?

Are you sure you're not drunk?



129

00:10:31.333 --> 00:10:32.667

I didn't drink!



130

00:10:32.667 --> 00:10:36.000

Wait, why are all of you here anyways?



131

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.333

If there's no hole in the wall, so be it.



132

00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:52.083

For now, we're falling back to Trost District!



133

00:10:57.417 --> 00:11:00.292

Whatever you do, don't let your guard down.



134

00:11:01.667 --> 00:11:03.917

We're going back ahead of you.



135

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.375

There's nothing wrong with the wall?



136

00:11:11.375 --> 00:11:13.792

What could this mean?



137

00:11:13.792 --> 00:11:18.167

There's been nothing like this in five years.

Why is it all happening now?



138

00:11:18.167 --> 00:11:21.125

This world is getting more and more out of hand.



139

00:11:21.125 --> 00:11:22.208

Eren.



140

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.917

Have a minute?



141

00:11:24.917 --> 00:11:26.667

We need to talk.



142

00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:28.958

What about?



143

00:11:30.167 --> 00:11:35.333

Five years ago, we demolished the wall

and began our attack on humanity.



144

00:11:35.333 --> 00:11:39.875

Oh no... What if there's a Titan

that dug a hole underneath the wall?



145

00:11:39.875 --> 00:11:42.708

The hole will be hard to find in that case.



146

00:11:42.708 --> 00:11:46.250

I'm the Armored Titan

and he's the Colossal Titan.



147

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:50.292

Right now, we need to focus

on getting Ymir back safely.



148

00:11:50.292 --> 00:11:54.167

Even with our horses,

we still have to worry about Titans.



149

00:11:54.167 --> 00:11:55.750

Huh?



150

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.167

What are you talking about?



151

00:11:57.167 --> 00:11:59.458

Why are you telling him, Reiner?



152

00:11:59.458 --> 00:12:04.792

Our primary goal was to ensure

all of humanity was wiped out,



153

00:12:04.792 --> 00:12:07.833

but now there's no need for that.



154

00:12:07.833 --> 00:12:08.833

Uh...



155

00:12:08.833 --> 00:12:09.917

Eren.



156

00:12:09.917 --> 00:12:15.792

If you agree to come with us, we won't

have to destroy any more of the walls.



157

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.042

Understand?



158

00:12:18.042 --> 00:12:19.042

Huh?



159

00:12:19.042 --> 00:12:21.917

No, wait! I don't understand at all!



160

00:12:21.917 --> 00:12:26.000

I'm saying... Why don't you just come with us?



161

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:32.958

They are easily transported and assembled and are built in

such a way to capacitate emergency and tactical deployment."



162

00:12:39.792 --> 00:12:42.875

I know this is sudden, but we need to go now.



163

00:12:42.875 --> 00:12:45.833

Right now? Where will you take me?



164

00:12:45.833 --> 00:12:47.875

I can't say that yet.



165

00:12:47.875 --> 00:12:52.875

But... Well, it's something like our hometown.



166

00:12:52.875 --> 00:12:55.167

So? What will it be, Eren?



167

00:12:55.167 --> 00:12:56.083

Uh...



168

00:12:56.083 --> 00:12:58.083

It's not a bad deal, right?



169

00:12:58.083 --> 00:13:00.667

You can easily avert this crisis.



170

00:13:02.292 --> 00:13:04.958

I wonder about that...



171

00:13:04.958 --> 00:13:07.917

Hey! We're leaving!



172

00:13:13.208 --> 00:13:15.625

What the hell?



173

00:13:15.625 --> 00:13:19.833

And here I thought I had

enough to think about yesterday...



174

00:13:25.875 --> 00:13:27.917

"12 hours earlier"



175

00:13:27.917 --> 00:13:29.042

"12 hours earlier"

Eren?



176

00:13:29.042 --> 00:13:29.625

"Ehrmich District"

Eren?



177

00:13:29.625 --> 00:13:32.000

"Ehrmich District"

What is it, Section Commander?



178

00:13:33.208 --> 00:13:34.292

Oh, well...



179

00:13:34.292 --> 00:13:40.292

I was finally able to get my hands on

the background report for Annie Leonhart.



180

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.500

Annie's?



181

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.750

Yeah.



182

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:49.250

It's taken so long to get it because managing

these reports is such a mess right now.



183

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.000

According to this,



184

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:57.417

there were two others belonging to the 104th

Cadet Corps who came from the same area as her.



185

00:13:59.417 --> 00:14:01.708

And those two are...



186

00:14:01.708 --> 00:14:05.708

...Reiner Braun... and Bertholdt Hoover.



187

00:14:12.583 --> 00:14:19.750

Thanks to the chaos five years ago, pretty much

all of their family records are spotty or missing.



188

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.542

However...



189

00:14:21.542 --> 00:14:27.083

During the long-range scouting formation,

their unit was given false information.



190

00:14:27.083 --> 00:14:32.000

They were among those purposely told

that Eren was in the right wing.



191

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:37.250

The Female Titan attacked from the right wing!



192

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.417

Huh? What does that mean?



193

00:14:39.417 --> 00:14:43.708

That it's possible they passed on

that information to Annie...



194

00:14:43.708 --> 00:14:45.708

Why? Why would they tell Annie?



195

00:14:45.708 --> 00:14:47.583

Hey, hold on a minute, Armin.



196

00:14:47.583 --> 00:14:48.500

You can't just--



197

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.333

I know that, Eren.



198

00:14:50.333 --> 00:14:53.542

By itself, that's not enough to prove anything.



199

00:14:54.708 --> 00:14:59.542

So just in case, I'd like to hear from you

how these three interacted during training.



200

00:14:59.542 --> 00:15:00.875

Know anything?



201

00:15:02.375 --> 00:15:05.792

I knew Reiner and Bertholdt

were from the same place, but...



202

00:15:05.792 --> 00:15:08.667

...they didn't seem close to Annie.



203

00:15:08.667 --> 00:15:09.750

I agree.



204

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:14.708

I don't recall ever seeing the pair

talking to Annie that much.



205

00:15:14.708 --> 00:15:18.500

Well, Annie didn't talk much in the first place.



206

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:23.583

When we ate, Annie would always sit alone

and munch on food by herself.



207

00:15:23.583 --> 00:15:25.542

Oh! I've got something!



208

00:15:25.542 --> 00:15:30.208

I heard a rumor she liked sweets,

even though she looks so grouchy!



209

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:33.792

I... don't remember.



210

00:15:33.792 --> 00:15:35.083

But...



211

00:15:35.083 --> 00:15:39.167

As their comrade,

I'd find it hard to believe.



212

00:15:39.167 --> 00:15:41.417

Set aside Bertholdt, who doesn't say much.



213

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:47.875

Reiner is like everyone's big brother,

and he's not devious enough to deceive all of us.



214

00:15:47.875 --> 00:15:50.042

I agree.



215

00:15:50.042 --> 00:15:54.000

Reiner gave everything he had

fighting the Female Titan with me.



216

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.667

He would have gotten crushed

in her hand if he hadn't--



217

00:15:58.917 --> 00:16:00.167

What's wrong?



218

00:16:01.167 --> 00:16:04.417

Reiner managed to escape, but...



219

00:16:04.417 --> 00:16:07.292

...Annie suddenly changed her course...



220

00:16:07.292 --> 00:16:10.333

...and ran in the direction of Eren.



221

00:16:11.458 --> 00:16:12.917

I...



222

00:16:12.917 --> 00:16:17.542

I did mention that Eren might be

at the rear of the center rank.



223

00:16:17.542 --> 00:16:19.958

But Annie was too far away to hear...



224

00:16:19.958 --> 00:16:21.542

Seriously?



225

00:16:22.958 --> 00:16:27.250

Did Reiner seem overly interested

in Eren's location?



226

00:16:30.583 --> 00:16:34.250

Then... Where the hell is Eren?



227

00:16:35.625 --> 00:16:37.042

It can't be...



228

00:16:40.917 --> 00:16:44.167

I only started talking about Eren's position...



229

00:16:44.167 --> 00:16:47.333

...because Reiner was the one

who asked about it first.



230

00:16:48.625 --> 00:16:50.667

Furthermore...



231

00:16:50.667 --> 00:16:54.792

...when that happened, the Female

Titan was staring at her palm.



232

00:16:54.792 --> 00:16:58.750

He might have written a message

with his blades in her hand.



233

00:17:00.167 --> 00:17:02.000

Reiner could've...



234

00:17:10.708 --> 00:17:15.167

What the hell? Why are you

saying things like this?



235

00:17:15.167 --> 00:17:15.625

--You should--



236

00:17:15.625 --> 00:17:16.708

--Eren!

--You should--



237

00:17:17.667 --> 00:17:20.292

No... Everyone, listen up!



238

00:17:20.292 --> 00:17:26.083

Supposing that we find Reiner or Bertholdt,

act in such a way as to not reveal any suspicions.



239

00:17:26.083 --> 00:17:30.583

Of course, do not make any mention

of Annie Leonhart either.



240

00:17:30.583 --> 00:17:33.625

Regardless if they're Annie's accomplices or not,



241

00:17:33.625 --> 00:17:37.583

we need to lead them

deep underground and confine them.



242

00:17:37.583 --> 00:17:39.250

Does everyone understand?



243

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.500

Yes!



244

00:17:49.792 --> 00:17:52.875

You're just tired, aren't you?



245

00:17:52.875 --> 00:17:54.625

Right, Bertholdt?



246

00:17:54.625 --> 00:17:57.750

You've been through so much,

it's making you crazy.



247

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.667

Y-Yeah.



248

00:17:59.667 --> 00:18:02.500

Reiner's just really tired.



249

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:07.542

Besides, if you were really the Armored Titan

that wants to destroy humanity...



250

00:18:07.542 --> 00:18:11.417

...why would you be asking me

this in the first place?



251

00:18:11.417 --> 00:18:16.708

What did you think would happen?

That I'd nod and say "Sure, let's go"?



252

00:18:27.833 --> 00:18:30.000

Oh, right.



253

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.750

That's right.



254

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.083

What the hell was I thinking?



255

00:18:36.792 --> 00:18:39.500

Have I really gone crazy?



256

00:18:42.333 --> 00:18:44.167

Come on, let's go.



257

00:19:15.333 --> 00:19:16.917

I see...



258

00:19:18.417 --> 00:19:19.958

That's it.



259

00:19:21.417 --> 00:19:24.875

I've been here too long for my own good.



260

00:19:26.667 --> 00:19:32.750

It's been three long years...

surrounded by nothing but idiots.



261

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:36.958

We were just kids... We didn't know anything.



262

00:19:38.792 --> 00:19:43.125

If only I never knew that

there were people like this...



263

00:19:43.125 --> 00:19:44.667

I...



264

00:19:45.667 --> 00:19:48.417

...wouldn't have become...



265

00:19:48.417 --> 00:19:51.333

...such a half-assed piece of shit!



266

00:19:53.458 --> 00:19:58.333

It's too late now...

I don't know what's right anymore.



267

00:19:58.333 --> 00:20:01.667

But the only choice for me now...



268

00:20:01.667 --> 00:20:04.917

...is to face the consequences of my actions...



269

00:20:06.208 --> 00:20:08.583

...and as a warrior...



270

00:20:08.583 --> 00:20:11.750

...fulfill my duty to the bitter end!



271

00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:17.875

Reiner!



272

00:20:17.875 --> 00:20:20.708

Are we doing it?! Now?! Right here?!



273

00:20:20.708 --> 00:20:22.083

Yeah.



274

00:20:22.083 --> 00:20:25.625

We settle this... right here, right now!



275

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.042

Eren!



276

00:20:39.042 --> 00:20:40.292

Run!



277

00:20:43.417 --> 00:20:44.875

Bertholdt!



278

00:20:50.583 --> 00:20:53.375

Eren! Get out of there!



279

00:21:32.542 --> 00:21:34.458

Ymir!



280

00:21:38.083 --> 00:21:39.208

Eren!



281

00:21:53.042 --> 00:21:55.917

I'm going to return to the hometown we lost.



282

00:21:55.917 --> 00:21:59.208

That's all I care about now.



283

00:22:05.792 --> 00:22:08.208

Bertholdt...



284

00:22:08.208 --> 00:22:09.833

Reiner...



285

00:22:14.458 --> 00:22:19.500

You damn traitors!



286

00:23:58.542 --> 00:24:01.167

The Colossal Titan...



287

00:24:01.167 --> 00:24:06.375

...as well as the Armored Titan,

engage the Scouts in battle.



288

00:24:06.375 --> 00:24:15.375

If their mission is to exterminate all of humanity,

there is no turning back for them now.



289

00:24:15.375 --> 00:24:19.208

Reiner and the others devote

their lives to the mission...



290

00:24:19.208 --> 00:24:22.417

...because they are warriors.



291

00:24:22.417 --> 00:24:27.094

Next episode: "Close Combat."

